-    /** Native offset the scroll handlers map: reverse lists on Android clamp (their bounce is off). */
+    /**
+     * Whether an out-of-range native offset should be pulled back into range right away.
+     * A reverse list on Android with bounce on reports the over-scroll translation as an offset
+     * past the range while the user drags or the bounce animates; that offset is visual only (it
